# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — OHOS libcxx-ohos std::ranges 算法缺失（all_of/any_of/equal） ═══
# Software: clang20-ccache 20.1.8 (upstream ccache v4.14), task clang20-ccache-20.1.8-r01-pc3-7-20260921T084618Z
# Gate: conan create (ohos-aarch64 profile) 全绿; unittest 243 例 240 通过(3 败为 HMDFS 硬链接平台限制)
# similar_to: DRAFT-332-openrct2-0.5.3-libcpp15-cpp20-compat; DRAFT-clang18-ccache-18.1.8-ohos-libcxx-ranges-algorithms
# Status: DRAFT — needs review to promote to E-entry

id:                     DRAFT-clang20-ccache-20.1.8-ohos-libcxx-ranges-algorithms
trigger_tool:           clang++|libc++|cmake
phase:                  compilation
error_signature:        no member named 'all_of' in namespace 'std::ranges'|
                         no member named 'any_of' in namespace 'std::ranges'|
                         no member named 'equal' in namespace 'std::ranges'
severity:               3
category:               platform, libcxx-stdlib, ohos, compat
match_keywords:         std::ranges, ranges algorithm, libcxx-ohos, LLVM 15, _LIBCPP_VERSION, all_of, any_of, equal
title:                  ohos-libcxx-ranges-algorithms-all-of-any-of-equal
root_cause:            OHOS SDK libcxx-ohos (LLVM 15.0.4, _LIBCPP_VERSION 15004) 的 <ranges> 头存在，
                       但 ranges 算法(all_of/any_of/equal 等)未实现，即使 -std=c++20 也缺失；
                       与既有 DRAFT-332 (fill/lower_bound)、DRAFT-clang18-ccache
                       (ccache 族 4 文件实证) 同属 libc++15 <ranges> 不完整族。
affected_scope:        OHOS 设备上使用 C++20 <ranges> 算法的三方库；LLVM 16+ libc++ / libstdc++ 不受影响
verification_cmd:      grep -rn "std::ranges::all_of\|std::ranges::any_of\|std::ranges::equal" src/ unittest/
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           source-patch
rec_description:       将 std::ranges::XXX(range, pred) 替换为等价迭代器版
                       std::all_of/std::any_of/std::equal(begin, end, pred)；Tokenizer 等
                       单表达式消费场景需先绑定到 const 局部变量再 begin()/end()。
rec_command:            find src unittest -name '*.cpp' -exec sed -i 's/std::ranges::all_of(/std::all_of(/; s/std::ranges::any_of(/std::any_of(/; s/std::ranges::equal(/std::equal(/' {} +
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               source-patch
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      change-cxx-standard
fallback_description:   仅因 C++ 标准过低触发时改 C++17；ranges 算法缺失无标准参数可解，必须源码替换
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:
forbid_1_pattern:       sed.*-i.*std::ranges.*-e.*s/.*\/\/.*/
forbid_1_reason:        不得用注释掉 ranges 调用或绕过检查的方式掩盖编译错误
forbid_1_consequence:   L1 测试缺失真实编译验证，finish 会拒绝
principles:             P-COMPAT-001
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             DRAFT-332-openrct2-0.5.3-libcpp15-cpp20-compat, DRAFT-clang18-ccache-18.1.8-ohos-libcxx-ranges-algorithms, E130